    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n8470" root="حفد" body-key="H">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَحْفُودٌ</span></b>  A man <i>served,</i> or <i>waited on, by others;</i>
(S, A, K;) and <i>obeyed:</i> (A:) one <i>whom his
companions serve and honour, and whom they
hasten to obey.</i> (TA.)

